<title>USA: HEI gets $1 million in orders.</title>
<headline>HEI gets $1 million in orders.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEI Inc said Thursday it has received orders totaling over $1 million for two microelectronic devices to be used by an unnamed major telecommunications equipment manufacturer.</p>
<p>Multiple prototypes have been under development for the customer over the past several months, and these two devices were the first to reach production release status, electronics company HEI said.</p>
<p>HEI shares were up 1/8 at 4-5/8 Thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
